// shell_typed_invocation witness is retired on exactly the condition it declared. The contract
// now pins the node's own oracle: authored, resolving, and RED; the dispatched worker is
// forbidden to edit it — an edit refuses verification as oracle-moved — and greens it by doing
// M1-M3 of the node row.
// THE HARNESS LINEAGE'S CLAIM CONTRACTS: one validation each -- the canonical witness gate for
// the lane the node owns. Validation is the claim runner's entry, not a prose obligation.
