    roadmap_node(
      identity: "rn_154WYEVN9KBKQ6FVGPSQR4Y2H2",
      id: "namespace-v2-import-completion",
      owner: "namespace",
      carriers: carrier(path: "dag/gunbc/plans/names_without_imports.dag"),
      line: ticket(t: updated(t: updated(t: updated(t: updated(t: fields(
          headline: "Decide whether an import list binds, and make it enforceable",
          boundary: "Record the chosen fully qualified declaration-reference rule and the import-free production transition. The earlier choice between import-scoped binding and bare-name reconciliation is superseded; implementation belongs to the qualified resolver, caller homing and grammar nodes.",
          displaced_cost: "A file that declares any import silently gets no bare edges, so the compiled population is decided by accident.",
          first_slice: "Reconcile this decision receipt with production_namespace_admission_precedes_seed_mirror_removal; the import-free production rule is already chosen. Resolver and parser work stays on its existing nodes.",
          red_control: "The recorded transition must require the sole qualified production resolver and import refusal in both parsers; a remaining ambient binding or accepted import keeps admission open.",
          out_of_scope: "Quieting the effect-summary join. (Deleting import syntax, XL-7, is withdrawn.)",
          handback: "The chosen-rule receipt reconciled with the concrete resolver and grammar handbacks, without reopening Q1 or waiting for unused seed mirror deletion."
        ), on: "2026-09-30", note: "Not yet centered: decide after declaration-identity-switchover lands; lean: do not make import lists bind — the refusal comes from the switch-over's single definition of in-scope, and the import grammar is scheduled for deletion (XL-7)."), on: "2026-11-08", note: "Superseded premise: import-grammar deletion (XL-7) is withdrawn, and imports are the terminal name mechanism (gunbc.design_ruling imports_are_the_terminal_name_mechanism). The binding decision is made with imports staying; a name is decided by declaration, explicit import, or qualified path."), on: "2026-11-16", note: "The question this node asks is answered by gunbc.design_ruling::imports_are_deleted_before_v2_is_accepted: an import list does not bind, because the import concept is deleted before v2 is accepted; in-scope is the switch-over's single definition. The out_of_scope parenthesis (XL-7 withdrawn) is superseded by that ruling and left as written. Serves gunbc.plans.names_without_imports."), on: "2026-11-19", note: "Source review at 398136026b345e087968a9db4ba42ec551c5ca4c (2026-11-19); source presence is not acceptance. The chosen import-free production rule is already recorded by gunbc.design_ruling::production_namespace_admission_precedes_seed_mirror_removal. Asking the operator to choose Q1 again is stale. Residual is reconciling this decision row and its evidence; resolver and grammar implementation are owned by their existing nodes.")),
      dispatch: dispatchable(),
      parent: in_project(project: "namespace-unique-on-chain", contribution: "Imports must either bind or be derived before resolution can say what a name sees."),
