        handback: "The build contents, the product runs, the build results, and proof nothing depends on it."
      ), on: "2026-09-30", note: "Not yet centered: after admission."), on: "2026-11-19", note: "Source review at 398136026b345e087968a9db4ba42ec551c5ca4c (2026-11-19); source presence is not acceptance. The seed Cargo feature list does not provide an interpreter-free product build. Quarantine is still real integration work: exclude the runner, classify actual link/consumer failures and run required products. A hand-Rust count reduction does not discharge this build obligation.")),
