      carriers: carrier(path: "dag/gunbc/non_fold_residue.dag"),
      line: ticket(t: level_fields(
          headline: "DP-M4: closed matches are total",
          boundary: "The host-discovered union of `data non_fold_residue_frontier` lists (co-located subject modules plus the stated std/extdeps exception list in gunbc.non_fold_residue) down to at most 100. The 13 mint-era src/v2/lens rows were totaled on main; remaining closed-match wildcards stay in their subject modules. The six seed-Rust wildcard sites are out of scope.",
