      line: ticket(t: updated(t: fields(
          headline: "The built v2 CLI compiles and emits v2.compiler.compile",
          boundary: "Build v2.cli.compile_cli (gunbc test //gunbc/instruments:v2-native-cli). Then use that binary to emit and build the compiler closure. Source acquisition goes through gunbc.source_root_read (#12391).",
          displaced_cost: "The status update says generation two is blocked on a crash for a missing file and on missing directory listing. The audit says #12391 already refuses a missing file and walks directories. The blocker should be settled by running it.",
          first_slice: "Verify the existing native CLI missing-root and directory/layout controls at the chosen generation-one identity, then build generation two over its own closure and record the first refusal.",
