          boundary: "M1.b: keying relations for the M1.a families, plus moving std.materialization_provider request_key off FNV to an approved family. Absorbs compiler-identity-invariant-under-corpus-commit.",
          displaced_cost: "Without keys, reuse across runs is either unsafe or impossible.",
