          boundary: "D13: DependencyDemand lives in v2.compiler.dependency_demand, produced once over resolved references keyed by resource declaration identity (native_demand_census_report). Cut (c) landed (#11993, #12125). This slice owns that producer and the census route. The census elides the uses clause; it does not rewrite aliases. A body that names a uses alias stays unobserved until resolve models the clause. UsesClauseCarrier refusal stays. Composition-root binding and production-resolve attachment are the next slice.",
