        displaced_cost: "Without the closure no retirement completes: srv2 cannot be declared converged even after its registrations are removed, and both fleet-srv2-retirement-completion and fleet-assessment-build-provenance-join wait on this one re-derivation.",
        first_slice: "Re-derive the assessment on current main with its witnesses ported as REDs first: typed refusals for an unadmitted local census, an unread roster, and an unproven build identity, and a receipt that names the executor and the removal postcondition rather than trusting a name.",
