        out_of_scope: "No signing infrastructure; no second actuator beside the reviewed plan/apply spine; the removal transaction itself belongs to fleet-srv2-retirement-completion; a --version string is not provenance on its own.",
        handback: "The closure consumed as the verdict of the fleet-converge retirement route: its typed blocker arms gate the convergence package and its receipt names the executor and the removal postcondition; fleet-srv2-retirement-completion stands on it through the join (gunbc.design_argument::consumption -- a named consumer over an executing route)."
