      line: ticket(t: fields(
        headline: "Optional-at-required tail: five modules outside every gated closure",
        boundary: "bmc_fan_monitor, bmc_fan_converge, fabric_required_build_cell, fleet_show_effective_read and srv3_install_media_fetch matched on their Optional first() sites so gunbc#11720's wall holds over them; the srv3 module's own Present/Absent variants shadow Optional's and must be qualified or renamed. Branch fierce-seal-607/optional-at-required-tail carries the uncommitted work.",
