        first_slice: "LANDED. determinism_compile_gate classifies through PrimitiveTraversalOrderFact: a call joins a PrimitiveIdentity by declared canonical name (primitive_identity_for_canonical_name), the identity carries one traversal order, and the order decides -- the two-row determinism_root_registry, its DeterminismRoot type and its v1.runtime_rust source refs are deleted. HostUnspecifiedOrder and TraversalOrderUnclassified refuse; CanonicalOrder, SourcePreservingOrder and the new OrderFreeResult accept. The denominator is closed over the DECLARED population by primitive_traversal_denominator_is_closed, checked in the door itself, so declaring a primitive without classifying it reds the gate on the next compile of any tree. NOT closed: primitive_undisposed_surface_symbol_count still counts the five-surface residue, and a MethodCall surface whose authored symbol differs from the canonical name does not join. REMAINING for this node: consume PrimitiveInvocationSurface so method-call spellings resolve, and close the surface residue.",
