        boundary: "The language has two construction walls. Native v2: v2.compiler.infer infer_sole_constructor_diags refuses foreign record literals, `as` casts, sealed coproduct variants, and parameter-default constructions, keyed on the declaring module (g0_type_decl_modifier_parse_without_sealing_property retired by that trigger). The ingest-bridge routes (parse_tree_to_target_model_bridge, cross_language_compile) are not that population: they infer foreign-language CoreNodes with no `.dag` declarations, so they cannot carry a sole_constructor type to seal. Seed v1: SoleConstructorViolation on record literal and cast (declaring-file comparison); coproduct variants (probe f13) and parameter defaults (probe f19) remain seed gaps and are not closed here. STILL UNVERIFIED on both routes: generic carriers and module_skips_direct_call_arg_check. Continue auditing by falsification; extend sole_constructor or ground the reference-grant algebra only where the audit reds.",
